base-files (4) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * /usr/libexec/pie-boot-partition prints the boot partition, on a ZFS
    root too. rc finds the authorized_keys file with it.
  * rc gives the keys and the home directory to the administrator, uid
    501, whatever its name.
  * rc makes the whatis databases only on a writable root.
  * The postinst records the 1777 modes of /private/tmp, /private/var/tmp
    and /private/var/folders/zz as dpkg statoverrides.

